<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $44-1/4 (FIM 201.63).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $44-1/4 (FIM 201.63).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed down $0-3/4 at $44-1/4 in New York on Monday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 201.63 markka. In Helsinki Monday, Nokia A closed up 1.50 markka at 203.90.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed $0-1/4 lower at $32-7/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 74.90 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.30 markka at 75.50.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS closed flat at $20-1/2 (93.41 markka) in New York. Rauma ended unchanged in Helsinki at 94.50 markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
